Specification repo: markdown spec and templates, plus standard-library Python scripts with no build or install step. Its checks, run from the repository root, are python3 scripts/check_crosswalks.py, python3 scripts/check_docs_prose.py and the test command of CONTRIBUTING.md, python3 -m unittest discover -s scripts -p 'test_*.py'; the pre-push review's build and new-user phases do not apply.
